/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/1/code.py:32:#     - Corner hit: pass into the wall cell and keep moving.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/1/code.py:33:#   - Different-color pair => normal base-task reflection plus color inheritance.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/1/code.py:36:#   - Wall sits at (r+1,c), i.e. horizontal wall that would flip dr.
