/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D4/1/code.py:49:#    accidental same-color matches. The repeated structure is: "different-colored wall adjacent to bounce, but
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D4/1/code.py:55:    Trace diagonal rays from triangular arrows, reflecting off colored wall pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D4/1/code.py:58:    - Rays still reflect exactly as in the original task.
