/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D7/3/code.py:54:#   - Original advance only painted cells when `out[nr,nc] == bg`, which is still correct for erased walls because erasure resets them to bg.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D7/3/code.py:55:#   - Original recolor-on-bounce checked `g[...] == bg`, which is no longer valid for erased-wall cells because input there is non-bg.
